---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Button from "../components/ui/Button.astro";
---
<Base title="About ANVERA" description="Discover the ANVERA philosophy: forged wheel design shaped by engineering discipline and individual expression.">
  <section class="about-hero"><div class="about-hero-inner"><p class="eyebrow">ANVERA / OUR PERSPECTIVE</p><h1>Driven by<br /><span>intention.</span></h1><p>We believe a wheel should do more than complete a vehicle. It should express its character, respect its engineering and reflect the person behind the brief.</p></div></section>
  <section class="about-statement"><p class="section-kicker">The brand philosophy</p><h2>Engineering is the foundation.<br /><span>Individuality is the expression.</span></h2></section>
  <section class="about-values">
    <article><span>01 / PURPOSE</span><h3>Designed with intent</h3><p>Every project begins with a vehicle, a use case and a clear design direction. Form is considered in context.</p></article>
    <article><span>02 / DISCIPLINE</span><h3>Precision over claims</h3><p>Technical details are reviewed, validated and communicated responsibly. We do not substitute marketing language for engineering evidence.</p></article>
    <article><span>03 / COLLABORATION</span><h3>Made around you</h3><p>We work from your requirements to define a considered configuration, with feasibility and fitment confirmed before production.</p></article>
  </section>
  <section class="about-cta"><div><p class="section-kicker">The next step</p><h2>Tell us what<br />moves you.</h2></div><Button href="/custom-inquiry" variant="primary">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></Button></section>
</Base>
